WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,320 --> 00:00:07,320
So hard

2
00:00:16,390 --> 00:00:18,590
Two months ago I would have been so happy to see these

3
00:00:18,590 --> 00:00:20,590
It’s not easy to spend money now

4
00:00:20,590 --> 00:00:23,730
This kind of thing should never be touched unless absolutely necessary.

5
00:00:23,730 --> 00:00:25,730
Don't let anyone find out

6
00:00:25,730 --> 00:00:41,460
Finally all opened

7
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:44,460
If this box had been in the past, it would have cost at least more than 20 million.

8
00:00:44,460 --> 00:00:45,460
Keep it first

9
00:00:45,460 --> 00:00:47,620
There will always be times when I can use it in the future

10
00:00:47,620 --> 00:00:50,180
What should have been placed here before was the Bandit's Hundred Swords.

11
00:00:50,180 --> 00:00:52,180
No wonder the space has been upgraded so much at once

12
00:00:52,180 --> 00:01:01,170
Driven crazy
